# Keep the risc0 reproducible-guest-build Docker context small and
# deterministic. risc0-build copies the whole `root_dir` into the build
# image; `noop_guest`'s context is the guest crate itself, but without
# this filter Cargo's `target/` (multi-GB after a host build) and `.git/`
# state would be shipped in, slowing the build and risking image-id
# drift from incidental local artifacts.
target/
**/target/
.git/
